WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.767
-Guys, did you ever see
a photo in the news

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:04.167
and think the headline could
be much better?

00:00:04.167 --> 00:00:06.100
Well, I'll show you what I mean.
It's time for "News &amp; Improved."

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:07.100
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:12.033
-♪ "News &amp; Improved" ♪

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:14.334
-For example,
check out this first photo.

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:16.300
The original headline was...

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:19.834
The headline
can definitely be improved,

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:20.901
because if you only
look at the photo,

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:21.968
the headline could have been...

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:27.934
Uh...May 6th.

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:30.000
-No.
-May 7th.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.300
-No.
-May 8th?

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.467
-No.
-Is it in May?

00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:34.701
-No.

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.267
-Check out
this -- Is your name May?

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:37.601
-No.

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:39.400
-Have you ever met anyone
named May?

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.400
-No. Well, once.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.801
-Good night, everybody.

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:46.334
Check out this next photo.
The original headline was...

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:50.767
If you only looked at the photo,
the headline could've been...

00:00:55.901 --> 00:00:59.501
"Don't --

00:00:59.501 --> 00:01:01.701
Mama needs her Franzia!"

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:04.334
The next headline was...

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:07.501
But the headline
could have been...

00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:12.367
It's like...

00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:16.133
"I'll be wearing
a bright-orange blazer."

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:17.200
Next headline was...

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.200
Headline could have been...

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.534
-Wow!
-That's terrible.

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:28.334
-ABBA?
-Mamma mia!

00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:30.834
-Yeah. Up next,
this headline says...

00:01:33.234 --> 00:01:34.234
Headline could have been...

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:40.167
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.234
Next headline was...

00:01:45.567 --> 00:01:46.701
Headline could have been...

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.701
Next headline was...

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:57.400
Headline could have been...

00:02:00.534 --> 00:02:02.934
The shower?

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:05.467
Drinking in the shower?
-Six shower beers? Wow!

00:02:05.467 --> 00:02:06.701
-Next headline was...

00:02:08.968 --> 00:02:09.968
Headline could have been...

00:02:12.567 --> 00:02:13.634
Oh, yeah.

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:17.434
"Freaking out!"

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:18.834
Finally, this headline was...

00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:22.801
Headline could have been...

00:02:27.567 --> 00:02:30.801
That is all the time we have for
"News &amp; Improved"!

